  "correction": "The mRNA vaccines ran on platform thinking — design the sequence, synthesise to order — which is exactly what delivered them at pandemic speed.",
  "why": "The pattern in the successes: each shipped product needed years of unglamorous optimisation after the elegant design — but the platform logic, not bespoke builds, is what scaled."
